           "color": "rgb(46, 46, 46)",
           "width": "929px",
           "marginBottom": "14.4px",
           "text": "R uth Esumeh is the founder of Ruth’s Marriage Counseling Services, a marriage counseling and coaching company that focuses on helping couples enjoy their marriage God’s way. Her practical, professional, and godly approach to her teachings has made her a sought-after marriage counselor in the indust"
          },
